OL,3,AArchbishop of Canterbury withdraws
OL,4,Aaward from Muslim cleric who praised
OL,5,AOsama bin Laden
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Archbishop of Canterbury has
OL,8,Fwithdrawn an award given to a Muslim
OL,9,Fcleric who praised Osama Bin Laden.
OL,11,FHafiz Muhammad Tahir Mehmood Ashrafi
OL,12,Freceived the award for reconciliation
OL,13,Fand interfaith cooperation from Dame
OL,14,FSarah Mullally last week, on the 25th
OL,15,Fanniversary of the 9/11 attacks.
OL,17,FLambeth Palace faced a backlash after
OL,18,Fit emerged Ashrafi praised Bin Laden -
OL,19,Fthe architect of the 2001 attacks - as
OL,20,Fsomeone who had "been fighting for
OL,21,FIslam against the Russians, Americans
OL,22,Fand British", in comments from 2007.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
