OL,3,AArchbishop of Canterbury withdraws
OL,4,Aaward from Muslim cleric who praised
OL,5,AOsama bin Laden
OL,6,
OL,7,FAshrafi also reportedly said he would
OL,8,Fgive Bin Laden the title Saifullah,
OL,9,Fwhich means "Sword of God". He told the
OL,10,FBBC his remarks had been "totally taken
OL,11,Fout of context".
